A USB device plugged in	插入了 USB 设备
A Windows update came before Microsoft published the files Windhawk needs to change the taskbar (taskbar.dll %s). Until they're out, the dock and the taskbar's look stay off and the island keeps working. They come back by themselves at the next sign-in after that.	Windows 更新早于微软发布 Windhawk 修改任务栏所需的文件（taskbar.dll %s）。在这些文件发布之前，程序坞和任务栏外观会暂时关闭，灵动岛照常工作。文件发布后，下次登录时它们会自动恢复。
A banner closes when you click anywhere outside it and the island; calls, alarms and reminders stay until you answer them	点击横幅和灵动岛之外的任何位置都会关闭横幅；来电、闹钟和提醒会一直保留，直到你处理它们
A bolt over her and she's proud; with her care on, it gives her energy	她头上出现一道闪电，她很自豪；开启照顾时，这会给她能量
A browser's download standing still shows paused	浏览器下载停滞时显示为暂停
A bubble on the island says when Caps Lock is turned on or off	大写锁定打开或关闭时，灵动岛上会弹出提示
A bubble on the island says when Num Lock is turned on or off	数字锁定打开或关闭时，灵动岛上会弹出提示
A card for each event: its switch, where its sound comes from and a play button. The three icons: the island's own sound, the Glass pack (25 small sound files, about 1.3 MB, downloaded once from jsDelivr's CDN, cdn.jsdelivr.net, the first time you pick it; only the files are asked for, nothing about you is sent) or a file of yours (.wav, .mp3...)	每个事件一张卡片：开关、声音来源和播放按钮。三个图标分别是：灵动岛自带的声音、Glass 音效包（25 个小声音文件，约 1.3 MB，第一次选择时从 jsDelivr 的 CDN cdn.jsdelivr.net 下载一次；只请求这些文件，不会发送任何关于你的信息），或你自己的文件（.wav、.mp3……）
A click on an item opens it; when you don't use it, the pill can shrink into a thin line	点击项目即可打开；不用时，胶囊可以收缩成一条细线
A click on the bell opens Windows' own notification center instead of the island's list	点击铃铛时打开 Windows 自带的通知中心，而不是灵动岛的列表
A cuddle, just one?	抱抱我，就一下？
A download finished	下载完成
A drive was connected	连接了一个驱动器
A file with all of it (agenda links too)	包含全部内容的文件（包括日程订阅链接）
A flash, and she's startled	一道闪光，她吓了一跳
A focus time ended	一段专注时间结束了
A grid on the pill that opens all your apps, Store apps too, like macOS: search them by typing, your favorites first (the star), then all of them in alphabetical order	胶囊上的网格图标，像 macOS 一样打开你的所有应用（包括应用商店应用）：输入即可搜索，收藏的应用（星标）排在最前，然后按字母顺序列出全部应用
A line while a window is maximized	窗口最大化时变为细线
A line with the mouse away	鼠标离开时变为细线
A little document copies itself beside her	她旁边会有一份小文档复制出来
A little fruit would be nice.	来点小水果就好了。
A long title keeps scrolling while it plays	播放时长标题保持滚动
A new notification	新通知
A new song	新歌曲
A notch with no items disappears, the one with the bell too. It comes back when an item or a notification comes to it, and while you drag items between the notches here. The strip kept on the screen stays the same	没有项目的刘海会消失，带铃铛的刘海也一样。当有项目或通知到来时，以及你在这里把项目拖到其他刘海时，它会重新出现。屏幕上保留的区域不变
A notification with a one-time code (4 to 8 digits, like a sign-in or a bank code) gets a Copy code button on its banner and in the list. The code goes to the clipboard and stays out of its history	带有一次性验证码（4 到 8 位数字，如登录或银行验证码）的通知，会在横幅和列表中多一个“复制验证码”按钮。验证码会复制到剪贴板，且不会进入剪贴板历史记录
A notification's text stays on one line, and under the mouse it scrolls to its end and back instead of opening on up to three lines. With animations reduced or off, it opens on three lines as usual	通知文字保持一行，鼠标悬停时滚动到末尾再返回，而不是展开为最多三行。动画减少或关闭时，仍照常展开为三行
