A right click on the island shows a gear: it opens these settings	在灵动岛上点击右键会出现一个齿轮，点它就能打开这些设置
A ring along the edge shows the charge: green above 40%, yellow down to 20%, red below. Not as the line, nor on the Bar style	边缘的圆环显示电量：高于 40% 为绿色，降到 20% 前为黄色，更低为红色。线条状态和条形样式下不显示
A screenshot	截图
A screenshot was taken	截取了屏幕截图
A short notice with the cover, title and artist when the song changes (not for pauses or the first song); a click opens What's playing	歌曲切换时显示带封面、标题和艺术家的简短提示（暂停或第一首歌不会显示）；点击即可打开“正在播放”
A sip of water?	来一小口水？
A small light that lives on the pill as an item of its own: move it in the order like the others, in every style. Her eyes follow the mouse, she blinks, dances with the music of the apps you check and shows what the PC is doing; she rests when nothing moves. While she moves the island is drawn again up to 30 times a second: on a slow PC, her dance and Her eyes follow the mouse off make it lighter	一个住在胶囊上的小光点，是独立的项目：可以像其他项目一样在顺序中移动，适用于所有样式。她的眼睛跟随鼠标，会眨眼、随你勾选的应用的音乐跳舞并显示电脑在做什么；没有动静时她会休息。她动起来时，灵动岛每秒最多重绘 30 次：在较慢的电脑上，关闭她的跳舞和“眼睛跟随鼠标”会更轻快
A sneeze	打喷嚏
A sneeze, by herself	自己打了个喷嚏
A sound for this event	为此事件选择声音
A summary of the PC, the island's settings and its last 300 log lines (the dock's are in Windhawk's log)	电脑概况、灵动岛设置和最近 300 行日志（程序坞的日志在 Windhawk 日志中）
A tap	轻拍
A task can be given a day. It shows under the task (red when it passed, not done), and the dated tasks come first, the soonest on top. Tasks without a date stay as they are	可以给任务指定一天。日期显示在任务下方（已过期且未完成时为红色），有日期的任务排在前面，最近的在最上面。没有日期的任务保持原样
