The apps heard playing, also players without Windows' media controls; with some on, only they bring it. With none on, any sound does	检测到正在播放的应用，包括没有 Windows 媒体控件的播放器；开启其中一些后，只有它们会显示可视化。全部关闭时，任何声音都会显示
The apps seen playing; a click turns one's lyrics off, and nothing of its songs is sent to lrclib.net	已检测到播放内容的应用；点击可关闭某个应用的歌词，其歌曲信息将不会发送到 lrclib.net
The apps seen playing; only the ones you check make her dance and react to songs. Empty until an app plays	已见播放过的应用；只有你勾选的应用才会让她跳舞并对歌曲做出反应。在有应用播放之前为空
The apps' notifications come in a capsule like the pill: the photo or icon at the left, the name and the message on one line, the app's icon at the right. Under the mouse it opens to the whole text and the reply. Calls, alarms and reminders keep their buttons as they are	应用的通知以和胶囊一样的胶囊形状出现：左侧是照片或图标，名字和消息在同一行，右侧是应用图标。鼠标移上去时会展开显示全文和回复框。来电、闹钟和提醒的按钮保持不变
The bar at the top, or upright on the left or the right edge, its items one under the other; windows keep out of its strip	栏位于顶部，或竖立在左侧或右侧边缘，项目上下排列；窗口不会进入它的区域
The bar doesn't minimize	栏不会最小化
The bar's inner corners	栏的内侧圆角
The bar's side	栏的位置
The bars' color; the rainbow gives each bar its own, going around slowly	条形的颜色；彩虹会让每个条形有自己的颜色，并缓慢变换
The battery icon's color while it charges; green is the usual, like a phone's	充电时电池图标的颜色；默认为绿色，和手机一样
The battery's charge while a laptop charges	笔记本充电时的电池电量
The bell opens Windows' notification center	铃铛打开 Windows 通知中心
The buttons on the panels	面板上的按钮
The calendar marks the days that have a task due with a small dash, and lists those tasks with the day's events, where a tick completes them. Needs the dates on tasks	日历会用小短线标出有任务到期的日子，并把这些任务与当天的事件一起列出，点击圆圈即可完成。需要先开启任务日期
The calendar opens as a card: today big at its left, the month beside it, buttons for the alarms, the timer and your agendas, and the day's events	日历以卡片形式打开：左侧大字显示今天，旁边是月份，并有闹钟、计时器和日程订阅的按钮，以及当天的事件
The charger plugged in	接上了充电器
The charger was plugged in	已插入充电器
The clock on the pill and in the calendar, in a font of its own	胶囊上和日历中的时钟使用单独的字体
The control center's buttons	控制中心的按钮
The cover's	封面颜色
The day's events and holidays under the month, the next ones and the button to add one. Off, the calendar shows only the clock and the month; reminders and the countdown keep working	月份下方显示当天的事件和节假日、即将到来的事件以及添加事件的按钮。关闭后，日历只显示时钟和月份；提醒和倒计时仍正常工作
The dock is chosen in Windhawk, in this mod's settings: Taskbar (the dock, the Windows taskbar transparent or with only the apps, or unchanged); the island can't change it	程序坞在 Windhawk 中此模组的设置里选择：任务栏（程序坞、透明或只显示应用的 Windows 任务栏，或保持不变）；灵动岛无法更改它
The dock is optional: it takes the taskbar's place, and it's chosen in Windhawk	程序坞是可选的：它会取代任务栏，需要在 Windhawk 中选择
The dock is set up in Windhawk	程序坞在 Windhawk 中设置
The edge zone as wide as the pill	边缘区域与胶囊同宽
The effect shown when the wallpaper changes	更换壁纸时显示的过渡效果
The favorite's drive isn't connected	收藏文件所在的驱动器未连接
The folder with your icons	存放你图标的文件夹
The folder with your wallpapers	存放壁纸的文件夹
The glass gets a sheen, a beveled edge, light along its bottom and a soft shadow around it, and the panels' cards look like glass too (idea by Thiago Silva)	玻璃获得光泽、斜切边缘、底部的反射光和周围柔和的阴影，面板中的卡片也呈现玻璃质感（创意来自 Thiago Silva）
The graphics card is flying!	显卡飞起来啦！
The hotspot isn't available now.	热点当前不可用。
The icons'	图标的颜色
The internet is back	网络恢复了
The internet went away	网络断开了
The island follows the mouse between screens.	灵动岛跟随鼠标在屏幕之间移动。
The island handles notifications and their sounds (Windows' stay quiet)	由灵动岛处理通知和声音（Windows 保持安静）
The island is the pill at the top of the screen: the clock, the control center, your notifications and what's playing	灵动岛是屏幕顶部的胶囊：显示时钟、控制中心、你的通知和正在播放的内容
The island shows the notifications and plays their sounds, Windows stays quiet	由灵动岛显示通知并播放提示音，Windows 自带的保持安静
The island stopped working	灵动岛已停止工作
The island takes the color of the app in front	灵动岛采用最前面应用的颜色
The island's	灵动岛的
The island's logs	灵动岛日志
The island's: no banners or sounds from it	灵动岛的：它不显示横幅也不发出声音
The items before the clock in the order stay at one corner and the others at the other, without changing sides as items come and go	顺序中排在时钟之前的项目固定在一角，其余在另一角，项目增减时不会换边
The keys below make the pill let clicks through to what's under it, and again take them back; it stays shown	下面的按键让点击穿透胶囊到达其下方的内容，再按一次恢复；胶囊保持显示
The keys below send the island to its line, and again bring it back	按下方的按键将灵动岛收为细线，再按一次恢复
The komorebi buttons also start and stop masir, so focus follows the mouse	komorebi 按钮同时启动和停止 masir，使焦点跟随鼠标
The komorebi buttons also start and stop whkd, its shortcut helper	komorebi 按钮同时启动和停止其快捷键工具 whkd
The line sung now on the pill (place it in the order above), all of them in its panel. Each song's title and artist are sent to lrclib.net (songs only: not videos, voice messages or the apps turned off below)	胶囊上显示正在唱的歌词（在上方顺序中调整位置），面板中显示全部歌词。每首歌的歌名和歌手会发送到 lrclib.net（仅限歌曲：不包括视频、语音消息或下方已关闭的应用）
The line's color, on the pill and lit in the panel	歌词行的颜色，用于胶囊和面板中的高亮
The list stays open after you click an icon (In the pill style)	点击图标后列表保持打开（仅限胶囊内样式）
The memory is packed!	内存被塞满啦！
The minimize arrow keeps the island open	最小化箭头让灵动岛保持打开
The mod's site	模组网站
The mouse at the edge, anywhere along the pill's width, brings it back, also with the line invisible	鼠标移到边缘胶囊宽度内的任意位置都能让它返回，线条不可见时也一样
The name has 1 to 32 characters (a letter outside English, like an accented one, counts as two or three).	名称为 1 到 32 个字符（英文以外的字符，如汉字或带重音的字母，算作两到三个）。
The next alarm that's on	下一个已开启的闹钟
The one chosen on the map	在地图上选择的屏幕
The password has 8 to 63 letters, numbers or symbols, without accents.	密码为 8 到 63 个字母、数字或符号，不含重音字符。
The password has at least 8 characters.	密码至少需要 8 个字符。
The pill as a loading bar	胶囊作为进度条
The pill can stay, or become a thin line while the mouse is away or while a window is maximized; the mouse on the line brings it back	胶囊可以一直显示，也可以在鼠标离开或窗口最大化时变成一条细线；鼠标移到细线上即可唤回
The pill fills like a loading bar with downloads	下载时胶囊像进度条一样填充
The pill fills with the battery's charge while charging	充电时胶囊随电量填充
The pill glows with her	胶囊随她一起发光
The pill lights up in several colors. Click (or press Space) only when it turns her color. Five rounds; the average counts, and each wrong click adds 300 ms to the total.	药丸会亮起多种颜色。只在它变成她的颜色时点击（或按空格键）。共五轮，按平均值计分，每次误点会使总时间增加 300 毫秒。
The pill shows the song's cover without its title. Hover it to read the title	胶囊只显示歌曲封面，不显示标题。将鼠标悬停在上面即可看到标题
The pill takes clicks again	胶囊恢复接收点击
The pill's and the panels' texts, in a font from your PC (click it again to pick another)	胶囊和面板的文字使用你电脑上的一种字体（再次点击可换另一种）
The pill's other items	胶囊的其他项目
The pill's shape	胶囊形状
The processor is sweating. So am I.	处理器在冒汗，我也是。
The progress apps show on their taskbar button (downloads, copies, installs)	应用在任务栏按钮上显示的进度（下载、复制、安装）
The room between the bars; the item grows with it	音频条之间的间距；项目会随之变宽
The settings' own icons	设置本身的图标
The sky as emoji, with the icon pack chosen in the Icons tab, or with a set of weather pictures downloaded once when chosen (Meteocons in color, Weather Icons in one color)	以表情符号显示天空，或使用“图标”选项卡中所选的图标包，或使用选中时下载一次的天气图片集（Meteocons 为彩色，Weather Icons 为单色）
The small pill with the time touches the screen's edge, straight on that side and as thin as its text, covering less of what's under it. The mouse on it opens the island as usual	带时间的小胶囊贴住屏幕边缘，该侧为直边，厚度与文字相同，遮挡更少。鼠标移到其上仍会照常打开灵动岛
The song changed	歌曲改变
The text's	文字颜色
The timer fills the pill with color	计时器用颜色填满胶囊
The title and the text, in the pill and in this list	标题和正文，显示在胶囊和此列表中
The volume changed	音量改变
The weather panel shows feels like, humidity, wind, UV, rain, pressure and clouds as small cards, like a phone's	天气面板以小卡片显示体感温度、湿度、风、紫外线、降雨、气压和云量，就像手机上那样
The weather service didn't answer	天气服务没有响应
The wheel on what's playing changes the song (not the volume)	在正在播放上滚动滚轮切换歌曲（而不是音量）
Their own	原有颜色
Their sliders talk to the monitor over its cable. Turn off if a monitor flickers or a dock or MST hub resets when the control center opens	它们的滑块通过线缆与显示器通信。如果打开控制中心时显示器闪烁，或扩展坞或 MST 集线器重置，请关闭此项
