VLC 3 doesn't tell Windows' media controls what it plays, so the island can't see it. With this on, while VLC makes sound, the island reads the song's name from VLC's window title, shows it with VLC's icon, and its buttons press play/pause, previous and next in VLC. No cover or time, and VLC must show the name in its window title (its default)	VLC 3 不会把正在播放的内容告知 Windows 媒体控件，所以灵动岛看不到它。开启后，VLC 发出声音时，灵动岛会从 VLC 的窗口标题读取歌曲名称，并用 VLC 的图标显示，其按钮会在 VLC 中执行播放/暂停、上一首和下一首。没有封面和时间，且 VLC 必须在窗口标题中显示名称（默认如此）
