Weekends	周末
Welcome to Mac Island & Dock	欢迎使用 Mac Island & Dock
What Claude Code in a terminal gives its status line (a line in its script, see the item's panel). The Claude desktop app doesn't leave its limits on this PC, so it can't show here	终端中的 Claude Code 传给其状态栏的数据（在其脚本中加一行，见该项目的面板）。Claude 桌面应用不会把额度留在这台电脑上，所以这里无法显示
