What's new	新功能
What's playing	正在播放
What's playing on the minimized line	最小化细线上的正在播放
What's playing's buttons and pictures	正在播放的按钮和图片
What's that?	那是什么？
When it hides	何时隐藏
Where banners show	横幅显示位置
Where did the internet go?	网络去哪儿了？
Where the island appears	灵动岛显示的位置
Where the items go along the bar. Automatic: around the clock when it's in the middle, otherwise at the right end	项目在条形上的位置。自动：时钟在中间时围绕时钟，否则靠右端
While a line is sung, it takes the title and artist's place; between lines they come back	唱到某一句时，它会代替歌曲名称和艺术家显示；句与句之间它们会回来
While a timer or Pomodoro counts down, the pill fills with color until it ends (orange, green on a break, fainter when paused) and pulses a moment at the end. The stopwatch doesn't fill	计时器或番茄钟倒计时期间，胶囊会逐渐填满颜色直到结束（橙色，休息时为绿色，暂停时变淡），结束时短暂闪动。秒表不会填充
While a timer, Pomodoro or the stopwatch runs, the line becomes a small pill with its ring and its time (with Only the clock, the time goes beside the clock)	计时器、番茄钟或秒表运行时，细线会变成一个带圆环和时间的小胶囊（开启“隐藏时只显示时钟”时，时间显示在时钟旁边）
While an app's window is maximized on this monitor, the bar goes back to its usual look (frosted, with the frosted glass on), so the window doesn't show behind it	当应用窗口在此显示器上最大化时，横栏恢复通常外观（开启磨砂玻璃时为磨砂），窗口不会透过它显示
While music plays in the apps checked below she dances, a new move each bar, following the beat	下方勾选的应用播放音乐时她会跳舞，每小节换一个新动作，跟着节拍
While music plays, a timer or the stopwatch runs, or a download or copy fills the pill, resting the mouse on that item (or on the pill, when only one is live) grows the pill into its card: the cover, title and buttons; the big time with pause and cancel; the percent. It shrinks back when the mouse leaves. Not for an item that Open panels with the mouse opens, nor with a banner place chosen	当音乐播放、计时器或秒表运行，或下载、复制正在填充胶囊时，将鼠标停在该项目上（或者只有一个活动时停在胶囊上），胶囊会就地展开为它的卡片：封面、标题和按钮；大号时间以及暂停和取消；百分比。鼠标移开后会缩回。对“鼠标悬停打开面板”已处理的项目无效，选择了通知位置时也无效
While something plays, the line becomes a thin pill with the song's cover and moving bars; the mouse on it opens the island, as on the line (with Only the clock, they go beside the clock)	播放内容时，细线会变成一个带歌曲封面和跳动条的细胶囊；鼠标移到上面会像细线一样打开灵动岛（开启“隐藏时只显示时钟”时，它们显示在时钟旁边）
While the app is in front, the pill moves there and shows only the lit icons.	当该应用在前台时，胶囊会移到那里并只显示点亮的图标。
While the app is in front, the pill moves there and shows only the lit icons. Dragging it then changes its place too.	当该应用在前台时，胶囊会移到那里并只显示点亮的图标。之后拖动它也会改变它的位置。
While the island is minimized to its line (or the Bar is hidden), she stays there in a tiny pill; the mouse on it opens the island, as on the line	灵动岛最小化为细线（或条形样式隐藏）时，她会待在一个小胶囊里；鼠标移到上面会打开灵动岛，和细线一样
While the timer runs	计时器运行时
White	白色
