Windows stopped while a monitor answered a brightness call (DDC/CI). To turn it on again: island settings > Control center > Brightness of external monitors (DDC/CI).	显示器响应亮度请求（DDC/CI）时 Windows 停止运行。要重新开启：灵动岛设置 > 控制中心 > 外接显示器的亮度 (DDC/CI)。
