Windows, Windows 10 and Emoji are Windows' own fonts. The online ones (all free to use: MIT, Apache 2.0 or ISC) go online once, when chosen: about 150 small SVG pictures are downloaded from cdn.jsdelivr.net (a plain request for each file, nothing about you or your PC is sent), kept in the mod's folder, and never downloaded again. An icon a pack hasn't stays Windows'. Your folder: a picture (PNG, SVG, ICO...) per icon, named after it	Windows、Windows 10 和 Emoji 是 Windows 自带的字体。在线图标包（均可免费使用：MIT、Apache 2.0 或 ISC）只在选择时联网一次：从 cdn.jsdelivr.net 下载约 150 个小型 SVG 图片（每个文件只发一个普通请求，不会发送关于你或你电脑的任何信息），保存在模组的文件夹中，之后不会再次下载。图标包里没有的图标保持 Windows 的样子。你的文件夹：每个图标一张图片（PNG、SVG、ICO...），以图标名称命名
With a click	点击
With a click, the line only grows under the mouse and opens when clicked (the hidden Bar's clock too)	选择点击时，鼠标移到细线上只会让它变粗，点击才会打开（隐藏的栏的时钟也一样）
With her games on she has fun too, which goes down while nobody plays with her. Bored, and later sad, she hops on the pill with a pleading look, at most every 30 minutes. Never in full screen, in Do not disturb or over a notification	开启小游戏后，她还有一项“乐趣”，没人陪她玩时会慢慢下降。无聊、之后变得难过时，她会在胶囊上轻轻跳一跳，用恳求的眼神看着你，最多每 30 分钟一次。全屏、勿扰模式或有通知时从不这样做
